{"slug":"other-bash-command","title":"other bash command","date":"2023-07-10","updated":"","tags":["bash","gossip"],"categories":[],"cover":"/img/cover/cover02.jpg","excerpt":"紀錄一些指令 由於上傳未包含nodemodules，因此下載後需要重新安裝 自己寫的上傳程式，包括: 、 、 整包上傳repro/{填寫的分支} 新增 config.yml 的githubdeploy，節省輸入的時間 這邊我是上傳至 .io 的gh-pages分支，設定在 config.yml","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<p>紀錄一些指令</p>\n<h2 id=\"set-up\"><a href=\"#set-up\">set up</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"run-server\"><a href=\"#run-server\">Run server</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">$</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> npm</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> inatall</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> --force</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>由於上傳未包含node_modules，因此下載後需要重新安裝</p>\n<h3 id=\"上傳至github\"><a href=\"#上傳至github\">上傳至github</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">$</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> pythone</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> PushGit.py</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>自己寫的上傳程式，包括:<span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>hexo generate</span></span></code></span> 、 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>hexo deploy</span></span></code></span> 、 整包上傳repro/{填寫的分支}</p>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>2023/7/18</span></span></code></span> 新增 _config.yml 的github_deploy，節省輸入的時間</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># _config.yml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">github_deploy:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> git</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">  repo:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> https://github.com/ImitatedSky/ImitatedSky.github.io</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">  branch:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> main</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">  message:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> 'deploy'</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> \"test message\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># pip install pyyaml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># PushGit.py</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">import</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> yaml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">import</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> os</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 讀取設定檔</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">with</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"_config.yml\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"r\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E06C75;font-style:italic\">encoding</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"utf-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">) </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">as</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> f:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">    config </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> yaml.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">load</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(f, </span><span style=\"color:#E06C75;font-style:italic\">Loader</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">yaml.FullLoader)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">github_url </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> config[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"github_deploy\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">][</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"repo\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">github_branch </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> config[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"github_deploy\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">][</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"branch\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"題外話-hexo-deploy\"><a href=\"#題外話-hexo-deploy\">題外話-hexo deploy</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">$</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> hexo</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> deploy</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># _config.yml</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># Deployment</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">## Docs: https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">deploy:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> git</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">  repo:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> https://github.com/ImitatedSky/ImitatedSky.github.io</span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"> # https://github.com/[你的 GitHub 帳號]/[你的 GitHub 帳號].github.io.git</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">  branch:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> gh-page</span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"> # 在這邊我是使用 gp-page 當作主要分支</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">  message:</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> 'deploy'</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>這邊我是上傳至 .io 的gh-pages分支，設定在 _config.yml</p>"}